      <title>亿万富翁普拉达氏族继承计划由Versace Deal提高</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/billionaire-prada-clan-succession-plan-bolstered-by-versace-deal</link>
      <description><![CDATA[几十年来，凶猛独立的Prada Spa董事长Patrizio Bertelli谈到了意大利时装屋需要获得规模和规模，以占领LVMH和Kering SA等庞大的行业庞然大物，并避免被他们吞噬。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/billionaire-prada-clan-succession-plan-bolstered-by-versace-deal</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
